Assent to Bills

SECRETARY-GENERAL: Madam, I lay on the Table the following four Bills passed by the Houses of Parliament during the Seventh Session of Eighteenth Lok Sabha and assented to by the President since a report was last made to the House on the 29th January, 2026:-

I. The Appropriation Bill, 2026;

II. The Finance Bill, 2026;

III. The Appropriation (No. 2) Bill, 2026; and 

IV. The Central Armed Police Forces (General Administration) Bill, 2026

I also lay on the Table copies, duly authenticated by the Secretary-General, Rajya Sabha of the following five Bills passed by the Houses of Parliament and assented to by the President:-

I. The Industrial Relations Code (Amendment) Bill, 2026;

II. The Transgender Persons (Protection of Rights) Amendment Bill, 2026;

III. The Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (Amendment) Bill, 2026;

IV. The Andhra Pradesh Reorganisation (Amendment) Bill, 2026;

and 

V. The Jan Vishwas (Amendment of Provisions) Bill, 2026.

